[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_UMBRUM]
Umbrum Cataclysm

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_UMBRUM_desc]
§g“And I looked, and behold, the umbrums! And their rider’s name was Sombra, and enslaved ponies followed him. And they were given authority over the Equestria land, to kill with shadow and with fear and with dark magic and by wild monsters of the world.”§!\nOpen the door of sin, give freedom to those terrifying beasts, give a home to those demons wandering on the tundra, share fear with the forgetful, provide death to the innocent.

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_UMBRUM_TOOLTIP]
Unlock a series of decisions for Sombra’s Empire：§YUmbrum Cataclysm§!

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_UMBRUM]
影魔现世

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_UMBRUM_desc]
§g“我凝视，嗟观，荒原影魔！他们的驭者名为森布拉，奴隶小马们紧随其后。他们被授予无上权柄，以统御小马利亚之土地，以阴影、恐惧、黑魔法之力，以及世间狂野妖兽之势，进行残杀屠戮。”§!\n打开那扇罪恶的门，重新赐予那些恐怖的猛兽以自由，重新给予那些冻原上流浪的恶魔以归宿，重新分享那些健忘者以恐惧，重新关怀那些无辜者以死亡。

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_UMBRUM_TOOLTIP]
解锁黑晶帝国系列决议：§Y影魔现世§!

